{"ok":true,"data":{"newsId":"NEWS-2026-00012","title":"Pelajar FKM Menang Tempat Pertama Pertandingan Robotik Kebangsaan","slug":"pelajar-fkm-menang-tempat-pertama-pertandingan-robotik-kebangsaan","summary":"Pasukan robotik FKM mengungguli 42 pasukan dari seluruh negara dalam kategori automasi industri.","categoryId":"CAT-003","categoryName":"Achievements","authorName":"Siti Aisyah (Demo)","imageUrl":"https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1JA2f2mV5IO4luLSfqanAha6PTjxJVoo3&sz=w1200","publishedAt":"05/09/2026","publishedAtRaw":1788583084602,"eventDate":"","views":989,"readMinutes":1,"lang":"en","hasFallback":true,"hasEnglish":false,"content":"<p>Pasukan robotik FKM yang dianggotai lima pelajar tahun tiga telah muncul juara dalam Pertandingan Robotik Kebangsaan 2026 yang berlangsung di Kuala Lumpur.</p><p>Projek mereka, sebuah lengan robotik penyusun automatik dengan sistem penglihatan mesin, dinilai berdasarkan ketepatan, kelajuan dan kos pembinaan.</p><p>Kejayaan ini melayakkan pasukan tersebut mewakili Malaysia ke peringkat serantau di Bangkok pada bulan November.</p>","fallbackFields":["Title","Summary","Content"],"seoTitle":"Pelajar FKM Menang Tempat Pertama Pertandingan Robotik Kebangsaan","seoDescription":"","seoKeywords":"","shareUrl":"https://fkm-it.github.io/fkm-news/b/pelajar-fkm-menang-tempat-pertama-pertandingan-robotik-kebangsaan","shareIsPublic":true,"tags":"DEMO, Pencapaian","images":[{"imageId":"IMG-00023","newsId":"NEWS-2026-00012","fileId":"1JA2f2mV5IO4luLSfqanAha6PTjxJVoo3","fileName":"demo-fkm10.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","sizeBytes":63469,"sizeLabel":"62 KB","caption":"","altText":"","sortOrder":1,"isFeatured":true,"isSelectedForSocial":true,"thumbUrl":"https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1JA2f2mV5IO4luLSfqanAha6PTjxJVoo3&sz=w1200","viewUrl":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JA2f2mV5IO4luLSfqanAha6PTjxJVoo3/view","uploadedAt":"16/09/2026 12:39"},{"imageId":"IMG-00024","newsId":"NEWS-2026-00012","fileId":"1jT88qM-iLZrQGeRiJHQ2EMqhOWESFcRd","fil